  "merger_description": "Karmo Holdings Pty Ltd (Karmo) proposes to acquire 100% of the shares in Submo Pty Ltd (trading under the name Simplr) (proposed acquisition).\n\nKarmo supplies vehicle subscription services for new vehicles in Australia from its hubs in metropolitan areas (including Sydney, Melbourne, Brisbane, Perth and Adelaide).\n\nKarmo is a subsidiary of Autoleague Pty Ltd (Autoleague). Autoleague is an automotive retail company which owns and operates motor vehicle dealerships across Australia.\n\nSimplr supplies vehicle subscription services for used vehicles across Australia.\n\nSimplr is a wholly owned subsidiary of Eagers Automotive Limited (Eagers),\u00a0an automotive retail group which owns and operates motor vehicle dealerships across Australia.\n\nSimplr sources its vehicles from its connected entity and sole supplier, Easy Auto 123 Pty Ltd (Easy Auto) in which Eagers has a 75% interest. Customers access Simplr\u2019s vehicles from Easy Auto\u2019s premises located in Sydney and regional New South Wales, Melbourne, Brisbane, Perth, Adelaide and Tasmania.",
